BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Skin of Youth
DTSTART:20260224T030000Z
DTEND:20260224T053000Z
DTSTAMP:20260224T030000Z
UID:Du8O6uQOUy
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 131 mins (2h11m)\n\n1990s Saigon. Two young LGBTQ+ l
 overs become entangled in the criminal underworld and must do battle with 
 dark forces that threaten their relationship and test the limits of their 
 humanity. Co-presented by SIFF and the UW Department of Asian Language and
  Literature. Post-film Q&A with Director Ash Mayfair\, moderated by Ungsan
  Kim.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/cinema/in-theaters/skin-of-youth\n\nEstimate
 d start: 19:15
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Uptown House 3\, 511 Queen Anne Avenue North
END:VEVENT
